WEBVTT

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.730
Goodness.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:21.780
It looks like I need to send you to
Wunder Bender at least once, Juzo.

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:59.980
Engineer

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:01.360
That power was far beyond
what I have heard.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:06.860
It seems we must rethink our
stance against Gun Slave Units.

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:13.440
Looks like we won't be able to track down
his real body from this sub-brain...

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.280
This case...

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.360
Victor was holding it.

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:28.280
The smell of extension grease.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:31.610
That means, inside of this...

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:44.820
I see!

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:48.780
So that small extension was stored inside.

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:53.940
It looks like that sub-brain is a normal one.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:03:00.030
Since that isn't a parallel sub-brain,
that isn't your real body.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:04.860
I surmise that must be an
extra remote body for you.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:12.190
However, it seems you are still
not quite used to controlling it.

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:15.570
Your movements have gotten quite slow.

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:17.940
Victor... No.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:21.610
The other Victor, I presume?

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:34.650
Though you were quite rough with her earlier,
it seems you still treasure your sister.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:37.650
How dull.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:43.650
Even so, this is why capturing
Extendeds is so troublesome.

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.360
Even if we catch the suspect,

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:50.780
there is always a mountain of paperwork
necessary to prove their identity.

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:53.860
There's really nothing more troublesome.

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:56.280
Don't you think so as well?

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.860
Mr. Inui.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.860
Juzo!

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:10.570
I thought you strait-laced types
believed in staying unaltered.

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:13.030
Those movements just now...

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:15.900
Looks like you've had some extension work done.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:21.070
Have you heard of the Ampullae of Lorenzini?

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:23.280
They are receptors found on shark skin

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:28.530
that can sense weak electrical fields
emitting from living creatures.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:34.150
I have a similar type of sensor
installed all over my skin.

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:35.440
Mary!

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:39.570
Juzo!

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:43.360
I lack the power to suppress either of you.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:46.480
However, even with my eyes closed,

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:52.190
I can easily sense your movements
and evade your attacks.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:58.190
It may not look like it, but I go
all out to increase my merit.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.980
Seems like it.

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:04.110
If you understand,
may I ask for your assistance?

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:08.940
Lead me to your real body. Right now.

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:12.480
Mary!

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.280
It's simple.

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:19.320
We have no way of defeating one another.

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:23.780
Yet, we both have something we want.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:28.900
Doesn't this seem like a perfect chance
for a mutually beneficial trade?

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:38.070
Seriously... Every single one of you...

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:41.150
You're all trying to get in the way of my job!

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.900
Juzo.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.570
I understand your feelings.

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:48.980
However, this is a negotiation
between him and me.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.940
Even though you are a Gun Slave Unit,

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:55.610
you are too wounded to get
your hands into this situation.

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:58.070
Not that you have any hands...

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:05.480
I can't believe someone like me
made such a dull remark.

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:07.150
My apologies.

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.360
You're right.

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.730
That joke ain't funny.

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:20.030
The grand ideals I had when
I agreed to this body...

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:23.530
I forgot that kind of shit a long time ago.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:28.400
Even so, there's one thing I've never doubted.

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:31.820
That reason!

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:39.360
It wasn't so I could just sit here,
unable to protect a single woman!

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:45.440
Deployment of skeletal lamination
compression, configuration zero.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:54.190
This is Juzo's true form?!

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:55.780
Functional diagnosis complete.

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:59.730
Damage extensive. Protective...

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.530
Damage extensive.

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:59.730
Protective smokescreen dispersed.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:06.860
Emergency brachial supplementation initiated.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:06.860
Supplement!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.230
Juzo!

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:13.030
Juzo, are you going against the program?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.940
Brachial connection manually released.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.940
Brachial... released.

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:20.320
Skeletal lamination compression,
secondary release.

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:20.320
Release!

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:34.440
Vertebral coupling bay. TH03 changed to 04.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:34.440
Vertebral... changed!

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:39.940
Spare arm connection procedure initiated.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:42.650
Initiated... nerve...

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:42.650
Nerve synchronization automatically adjusted.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:45.900
This is bad.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.400
I'm losing consciousness.

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:58.280
I-I've already told you!

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:02.400
Smokescreens have no effect on me!

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:06.820
This is!

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:10.570
So many electrical signals around us!

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:14.190
E-Even so, I still have a hostage!

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:16.940
What?!

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:23.440
You!

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:36.610
You're lucky these arms have just been
connected and have no power behind them.

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:48.320
What in the world were you thinking?!

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:58.190
In order to confuse Avi, he dismantled
his own arm and scattered them about?

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:04.570
You're lucky I forced the program to shut down.

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:09.230
What were you going to do if you
went berserk without a Hands?

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:13.070
Stopping that is the job of a personal engineer.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.610
What did you say?

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:17.030
I don't know anything about you,

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:23.820
but the guy your personality came from
would've said something like that.

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:33.860
The EMS, huh?

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:38.280
They really don't know how to read the mood.

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:43.650
What are you planning to do?

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:47.780
It's your job to finish things with him, right?

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:53.400
Don't worry. I can at least earn us some time.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.070
Wait, Juzo!

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:04.360
Drop your weapons and surrender!

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:08.900
Wha?! This guy!

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:11.070
Substitute Director Avi!

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:21.110
Didn't I tell you? Don't get
involved with Extendeds.

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:28.570
You have Victor's memories, don't you?

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.980
Even if that's true, so what?

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.110
Please tell me.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:37.230
When he left that house, what happened
between him and the old man?

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:43.070
You knew he was looking for a successor.

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:47.780
Even so, I told him that I wanted to
join the military as an engineer.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:53.280
At the time, all extension technology
was researched in the military.

00:10:53.280 --> 00:11:00.190
When I said that, he told me he
would sell your body if I did leave.

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:08.440
To be honest, I don't really remember
what happened after that.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:14.230
Before I realized it, that man was
already caught up in the winch.

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:15.860
That's all.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:24.690
It wasn't something I had planned to do,
but I don't regret how it turned out.

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:26.400
No way...

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:31.440
But!

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:34.980
Why didn't you say anything to me?!

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:37.650
Why did you leave me behind?!

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:42.320
I loved you very much.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:49.280
At the same time, I was completely
enthralled by extension technology.

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:54.030
I was driven by my mission to promote
extension technology to the world.

00:11:54.030 --> 00:12:02.030
I thought I would be able to empower those
who had lost the things they treasured.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:05.650
But it was a forbidden power.

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:08.230
Extension technology not
only changed their body,

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:12.280
but changed their soul to something inhuman...

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:16.150
You've seen it yourself as
an engineer, haven't you?

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:20.690
Extendeds that fall into madness!

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:23.280
I wanted to confirm it all.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:25.480
The significance of extension technology.

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:27.650
The nature of Extendeds.

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:33.360
That's why you helped Spitzbergen
and provoked Juzo?!

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.690
It's funny.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:43.280
Before I realized it, I had become a monster
known as the Dismantler, myself.

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:50.780
I've passed the point of no return.

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:56.150
I can't stop until the Extendeds that
I have created are all destroyed.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:58.110
Why?

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:04.690
Then... why were you trying
to look inside of Juzo?

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:06.190
That...

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:09.440
It's true.

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:14.150
You just took a part of Victor's thought
pattern and expanded on it!

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:19.030
It's true that I am like a copy of Victor.

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:20.530
But I am me.

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:21.730
You're wrong!

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:28.150
Even if you share Victor's thoughts,
you aren't Victor!

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:33.530
Maybe I didn't really understand Victor.

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:35.780
But there is one thing I'm sure of!

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:39.980
When Victor disappeared,

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:45.530
I wanted to know the reason so
badly that I became an engineer.

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:48.190
I copied him as I remembered him

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:52.900
so I could understand his
feelings as much as I could.

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:56.650
There was even a time when
I felt pride in my work.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:14:00.190
But I realized it one day.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:04.820
Even if they lose something and
fall into despair in the moment,

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:09.860
humans have the strength to support
what they've lost with something else.

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:13.570
The only thing that extension
technology and engineers can do...

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:16.820
...is give them a small push forward.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:19.360
I'm sure it's true that
Victor saw the battlefield

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:24.070
and realized the dangers
of extension technology.

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:26.110
But when listening to Lefty...

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:29.900
When I listened to Victor, I confirmed it.

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:34.190
The <i>real</i> Victor had also realized this.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:41.110
His thinking that his skills made
people stronger. It was his own hubris.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:48.190
You! How can an unaltered person
like you understand Extendeds?!

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.150
I do.

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:55.360
I just have to look at their faces.

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:10.280
Do you really have nothing to do
other than to cause trouble?

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:12.400
You're really too much.

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.610
You...

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:17.480
However, you're not the one
I have business with today.

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:23.690
What in the world...?

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:27.360
In your impatience to capture Victor,

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:31.820
you are under suspicion of
working with Spitzbergen.

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:40.940
I'll hear your excuses back at the office,
ex-substitute EMS director, Avi.

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:45.150
Olivier! You bitch! What right do you have...?

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:45.150
Take him away.

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:52.980
You should take this chance to run.

00:15:52.980 --> 00:16:00.570
If you get caught by the EMS, they'll use
your sub-brain to find Victor's body.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:03.280
I still have more to say to you, too.

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:06.530
Now, I've changed the wiring of your arm.

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.320
You won't be able to do
naughty things like before.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.150
Just now?!

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:14.030
And let me check one thing.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:17.230
The hostages. Where are they?

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:19.650
They're safe, right?

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:23.230
You don't have to worry about the hostages.

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:29.190
The child would probably be
safer if he stayed with them.

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:31.360
What do you mean by that?

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:37.360
Your hair. Looks like you're
able to braid it yourself now.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:42.690
I still wish you never became an engineer.

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:46.030
You've become a more respectable one than me.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:49.190
Victor...

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:04.610
Victor, someday, with my own hands...

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:11.480
There's no need to be scared.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:15.280
It's just a bit. Just a little bit!

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:17.610
Lefty, prepare yourself!

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:19.650
Ah! Wait! Hey!

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:21.980
Ouch....

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:24.480
What in the world are you doing?

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:28.190
I wanted to take a quick peek inside Lefty...

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:35.320
Are siblings all so similar like this?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.860
Did you say something?

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:40.980
What will you be able to
figure out by examining him?

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:47.190
Lefty is just a left-hand part without
a sub-brain, so we can't see his logs...

00:17:56.980 --> 00:18:00.150
He has the intelligence of a dog.

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:06.730
We can't talk with him, and it may be
impossible for him to take us to Victor...

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:09.820
...but I'm really interested in how
he can move so independently!

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:11.230
So that's it.

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:17.110
Well, we have no choice but
to patiently look for Victor.

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:23.650
First, you need to let yourself heal up.

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:27.780
You can't replace a human
body like you can mine.

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:30.900
I know that. But--

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:36.320
Don't worry about them.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:38.480
What are you planning to do?

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:52.070
Come in.

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:56.570
How are you feeling, Master Tetsuro?

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:58.440
What is the meaning of this?

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:03.610
I heard that Harmony would interfere
with getting my own voice back.

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:04.900
That's why I...

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:08.400
That must have been quite inconvenient.

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:14.150
I am glad I got the best engineer
that I knew to take care of it.

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:18.190
I'd like to ask you one thing.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:20.030
Anything you wish.

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.980
I barely have any memories of you.

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:23.820
However, I do know that name.

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:28.190
Well, there is no one in this
country who doesn't know of you.

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:30.480
Professor Wachowski.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.150
The father of extension technology.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:39.070
You developed Extendeds during the
great war and brought victory to the country.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:42.900
It is an exaggeration to call me as such.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:48.230
I was merely one of the researchers that
developed the base theory of extensions.

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:52.320
Why is someone like you
helping terrorists like this?!

00:19:52.320 --> 00:20:00.940
I could pose the same question to the
son of Berühren's CEO, Master Tetsuro.

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:03.440
There is no way I'd do such a thing!

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:08.820
Even if you've lost your memory,
the facts will not change.

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:14.530
If... If that were true, why would
I do something like that?!

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:18.400
That is not something I would know for sure.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:24.230
However, Berühren's treatment
of you says it all.

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:29.280
The fact that you support Spitzbergen is true.

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:36.070
And, as our supporter, we only
wish of one thing from you.

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:41.320
The Gun Slave Unit working
with Berühren, also known as Seven.

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:46.980
He has become a great
obstacle in our activities.

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:53.070
However, only a Gun Slave Unit can
go against another Gun Slave Unit.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:59.150
You wish to use us as hostages to have
Juzo eliminate that Gun Slave Unit?

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:01.650
It is just as you say.

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:03.820
However, not quite right.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:08.360
Inui Juzo currently has no
chance of beating Seven.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:12.980
You don't seem convinced.

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:20.230
However, I know everything
about Juzo Inui... Device 13.

00:21:20.230 --> 00:21:22.860
For a Gun Slave Unit to fully function,

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:30.230
they must give up their will
and fully become a tool.

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:31.860
Tool?!

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:40.650
We would like you to use Harmony to
pull out his true form, Master Tetsuro.

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:47.070
We have been keeping a tab
on all of those close to you.

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:55.730
We will ensure their safety as
long as you cooperate with us.

00:23:27.530 --> 00:23:30.230
You have the data, don't you?

00:23:28.480 --> 00:23:30.230
We'll get them by surprise this time.

00:23:30.230 --> 00:23:33.780
Uh, did you want to get a cut?

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:35.570
I mean, Juzo is super dense.

00:23:33.780 --> 00:23:35.570
Just a shampoo.

00:23:35.570 --> 00:23:41.570
<i>NO GUNS LIFE</i> . Episode 17.
"Noble Rot."
